  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Ilenia Gradante; edition source: autopsy Ilenia Gradante, August 2019</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div--interpretive\">  <a id=\"a-l1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>Caecilior(um) Serv-<span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span><br id=\"a-l2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>iliani et Potiti <span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span><br id=\"a-l3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>Herenniani iun(ioris) <span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span></span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Ilenia Gradante; edition source: autopsy Ilenia Gradante, August 2019</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div--diplomatic\"><a id=\"a-l1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>CAECILIORSERV<span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span><br id=\"a-l2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ILIANIETPOTITI<span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span><br id=\"a-l3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>HERENNIANIIUN<span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic010019_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic010019_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic010019.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic010019-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic010019_profile_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic010019_profile_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic010019_profile_tiled.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic010019_profile_tiled-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text from autopsy.</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7176-2833\">Ilenia Gradante</a></p>  <p>of Caecilii Servilianus and Potitus (and?) Herennianus the younger.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7176-2833\">Ilenia Gradante</a></p>  <p>dei Caecilii Servilianus e Potitus (e?) Herennianus il giovane.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Family company, composed of two or three members, depending on whether one wants to recognise one - Potiti Herenniani iun(oris) - or two - Potiti (et) Herenniani iun(ioris) - distinct persons in the second part of the text.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 10.8059.91 </li><li> Libertini 1930 143 </li><li> Manganaro Perrone 2006 18, no. 3 </li><li> Gradante 2026 no. 11 </li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1  5  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence </div>",
